@flowerinthewild-x5u a student should study. A doctor / advocate should practice medicine / law. What has Kerala or India gained due to SFI or parties in Kerala universities? Student leaders manipulating their results, attacking teachers, murdering students, some leaders are drug agents. 
Students should not play politics . Join politics after education and play politics. Otherwise, it is comparable with MBBS / LLB students, actually prescribing medicines or working as advocates in courts . 
Unions are useful only If college politics is 100% about motivating students to study or supplying study materials or encouraging physical / mental fitness (games, yoga ), providing counseling for weak or depressed students ,or career guidances.

@flowerinthewild-x5u  Duties and responsibilities of students are defined in the admission documents executed by students and parents . Students should restrict their duties and responsibilities accordingly. Students are expected to,devote 100% time for studies and extra curricular activities defined for them. Students are not expected to Implement democracy in college . By adopting your logic, let  there be unions in cricket academy, athletics school, Space research Institutions also. Let students and teachers form unions in these institutions and run unions in the same model being witnessed in Kerala universities. 

Further Unions role is not monitoring management functions in the college. The objective of union as defined in the bye laws while registering the unions, does not include this activity for unions.  

If there is any violation of law by management, police agencies will take action.

@flowerinthewild-x5u yes,  country created a bad culture  even for police which have pushed the nation far behind, even behind China. In fact India was ahead of China in 1990 but by 2010, China has become world No 1. Unions are prohibited in Communist China, perhaps a reason for progress. Unions are prohibited in 58 Islamic nations too. 
The new generations , students should take corrective measures and eradicate the bad culture from India. So students should abandon the present union culture and adopt truth justice and non-violence. If students in Kerala carry forward the u ion culture in to their profession either employment or entrepreneurship, the profession or enterprise will collapse. New enterprises around the world don’t allow unions. Similarly when you become a self- entrepreneur, you will not allow your employees to form unions . Therefore better don’t learn unionism in colleges which is not going to help in your profession in future, instead learn technology, acquire knowledge, develop service mindedness, read stories about empathy, positivity, humility, simplicity, non-violence, truth and become a good human being while becoming a successful professional.

In Kerala SFI u ion leaders and congress / Kerala,congress/ Mulim league unions too get marks and mark sheets freely thereby stud ets who study well are demotivated and a bad culture is created by unions in campus

